IMPLEMENTED BACKEND MODULES
----------------------------
1. Image/video deepfake detection
   - File: backend/modules/image_video/detector.py
   - Models: Xception or ResNet18
   - Endpoint: POST /api/detect
   - Checkpoints: deepfake_detector.keras or resnet18_deepfake_best.pth
   - Uses demo_fallback when weights are unavailable.

2. Hybrid AI text detection
   - File: backend/modules/text/detector.py
   - Source notebook: Untitled1.ipynb
   - Model: DeBERTa-v3-small with BiLSTM, CNN, Transformer, and attention fusion
   - Input: pasted text or UTF-8 .txt upload
   - Endpoint: POST /api/analyze with modality=text
   - Checkpoint: backend/modules/text/best_text_detector.pt
   - Override: TEXT_DETECTOR_MODEL_PATH

3. Audio deepfake detection
   - File: backend/modules/audio/detector.py
   - Source notebook: Untitled44.ipynb
   - Model: Wav2Vec2-base with CNN, BiLSTM, and attention pooling
   - Preprocessing: mono, 16 kHz, padded/truncated to 5 seconds
   - Input: .wav or .mp3 upload
   - Endpoint: POST /api/analyze with modality=audio
   - Checkpoint: backend/modules/audio/best_model.pt
   - Override: AUDIO_DETECTOR_MODEL_PATH

4. Document forgery detection
   - File: backend/modules/document/detector.py
   - Endpoint: POST /api/detect-document
   - Formats: jpg, jpeg, png, pdf, tiff, tif
   - Current behavior: demo fallback until model weights are available.

